    "updated_at": "2026-11-17T16:08:55Z",
    "body": "Thank you for this clear request, and for doing the work.\n\nTriage: `P6` (an accepted enhancement), `effort:medium` (one UI page with a known pattern), `area:ui`. The workaround (View > Machines > \"Use for this setup\") stays available until your change merges.\n\nClaim recorded for @roer70 - label and assignee set (only collaborators can set labels; your comment is the claim). We read rely-roer and roer70 as the same person, as you wrote.\n\nYour plan matches how the Machines pane works. Some notes for the PR:\n- Keep the selection undoable through the same `UseCatalogueMachine` command, so Ctrl+Z puts the previous machine back.\n- Please show the machine's own name and its file name, as you proposed, so two copies of the same shipped machine can be told apart.\n- A refused file must stay visible with its reason and must not be selectable.\n- Please do not change any snapshot PNG; the UI structural tests are the place for the assertions (see `crates/ui/AGENTS.md`).\n\nClean-room note: please use only your own work and CamCraft's code. Do not copy text or images from Fusion 360 or HSMWorks.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
